- **University of Minnesota Cardiac Atlas**: https://www.vhlab.umn.edu/atlas - Free educational resource with live videos and still images of reanimated human hearts

**Stock Image Resources:**
- **Adobe Stock Anatomical Hearts**: https://stock.adobe.com/search?k=anatomical+heart - Thousands of royalty-free anatomical heart images and videos
- **Servier Medical Art**: https://smart.servier.com/category/anatomy-and-the-human-body/cardiovascular-system/heart - Informative cardiovascular system illustrations including blood circulation and cardiac muscle
- **iStock Medical Heart Illustrations**: https://www.istockphoto.com/illustrations/medical-illustration-heart - 5,000+ medical illustration heart stock illustrations and vectors','[{"id":"call_0f18a84cf8b0474a939f84fa","name":"search_medical_references","args":{"query":"heart anatomy image resources educational medical illustrations","maxResults":5}}]','[{"toolCallId":"call_0f18a84cf8b0474a939f84fa","toolName":"search_medical_references","content":"{\\"results\\":[{\\"title\\":\\"Heart: illustrated anatomy | e-Anatomy\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://www.imaios.com/en/e-anatomy/thorax/heart\\",\\"snippet\\":\\"This interactive atlas of human heart anatomy is based on medical illustrations and cadaver photography. The user can show or hide the anatomical labels\\",\\"host\\":\\"www.imaios.com\\",\\"date\\":\\"\\"},{\\"title\\":\\"Atlas of Human Cardiac Anatomy - University of Minnesota\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://www.vhlab.umn.edu/atlas\\",\\"snippet\\":\\"The atlas of human cardiac anatomy has live videos and still images of reanimated human hearts … free to download and use for educational purposes.\\",\\"host\\":\\"www.vhlab.umn.edu\\",\\"date\\":\\"\\"},{\\"title\\":\\"Anatomical Heart Images – Browse 157890\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://stock.adobe.com/search?k=anatomical+heart\\",\\"snippet\\":\\"Search from thousands of royalty-free Anatomical Heart stock images and video for your next project. Download royalty-free stock photos, vectors, ...\\",\\"host\\":\\"stock.adobe.com\\",\\"date\\":\\"\\"},{\\"title\\":\\"Heart - Servier Medical Art\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://smart.servier.com/category/anatomy-and-the-human-body/cardiovascular-system/heart\\",\\"snippet\\":\\"Servier Medical Art''s Heart category provides informative illustrations on the cardiovascular system, including the circulation of blood, cardiac muscle, ... Read more\\",\\"host\\":\\"smart.servier.com\\",\\"date\\":\\"\\"},{\\"title\\":\\"Medical Illustration Heart Illustrations\\",\\"url\\":\\"https://www.istockpho