INSERT INTO "AgentThreadMessage" ("id","threadId","role","content","toolCalls","toolResults","metadata","createdAt") VALUES ('cmvj3ebvd0009yiu8id385q26','0393944e-1fd0-4325-bffc-420f132f5106','assistant','I''ll set up a daily question generation challenge for you! Let me create a recurring task that will generate questions each day.

Perfect! I''ve set up your **Daily Question Challenge**. Here''s what''s been scheduled:

📅 **Daily Question Challenge**
- **Schedule**: Every day at 9:00 AM UTC
- **Task**: Generate 5-8 multiple choice questions on a random medical system/topic
- **Next run**: October 22, 2026 at 9:00 AM UTC

Your daily challenge will automatically generate questions each day and deliver them as a mini quiz with explanations. The questions will focus on your weak topics when available, otherwise they''ll rotate through different medical systems.

You can manage this challenge anytime through the scheduled tasks section (clock icon in the assistant panel) - you can pause, resume, run it immediately, or delete it if needed.

