-blocker, ... Read more\\\\n[S3] ACC Treatment of Heart Failure With Reduced Ejection (Mar 8, 2024)\\\\n    https://www.guidelinecentral.com/guideline/3541465/?srsltid=AYCX9vLdBF4LZtYzSYBG8ZlIGN7DXZ_YrFVA98pRh5KxEPUqV5nEbg-u (www.guidelinecentral.com)\\\\n    Mar 8, 2024 — The purpose of this document is to update the 2021 ECDP with further data from recent studies and to provide succinct, practical guidance for ... Read more\\",\\"note\\":\\"Cite these inline as [S1], [S2]… markers placed right after the claim each source supports. NEVER paste raw URLs into the answer text — the interface renders [S#] markers as clickable source cards and lists every URL in a Web sources panel automatically. Results are re-ranked for recency (freshest first): when a source carries a date, mention the year the moment you cite it (e.g. \\\\\\"per the 2024 ESC guideline [S1]\\\\\\"), and prefer the most recent guidance when sources conflict — flag older sources as superseded where relevant.\\"}","isError":false}]',NULL,'2026-10-24T07:35:00.994Z');
