Here''s how we''ll allocate your 6 weeks based on exam weights and your weak areas:

| Week | Focus Area | Weight % | Strategic Reason |
|------|------------|----------|------------------|
| **Week 1** | General Principles + Cardiovascular | 24% | Foundational + your weak area |
| **Week 2** | Respiratory & Renal | 17% | Highest weight area |
| **Week 3** | Behavioral Health & Nervous System | 13% | Medium weight, needs reinforcement |
