| **Week 5** | Gastrointestinal + Endocrine | 17% | Addresses your GI weakness + endocrine |
| **Week 6** | **FINAL REVIEW & PRACTICE** | - | Comprehensive review + weak area focus |

### 🎯 **Week-by-Week Breakdown**

#### **Week 1: General Principles + Cardiovascular (24% weight)**
- **Days 1-2**: General Principles (biochem, cell bio, genetics)
- **Days 3-5**: Cardiovascular physiology and pharmacology
- **Daily**: 50 practice questions with focus on anemia and cardiovascular topics

#### **Week 2: Respiratory & Renal (17% weight)**
- **Days 1-3**: Respiratory system
- **Days 4-6**: Renal/Urinary system
- **Daily**: 50 practice questions

#### **Week 3: Behavioral Health & Nervous System (13% weight)**
