*Source: Animus Medicus*

These images show various views of heart anatomy including cross-sections, labeled diagrams, and anatomical details. The images include proper labeling of major structures like the atria, ventricles, aorta, and vena cava, which are essential for understanding cardiac anatomy.','[{"id":"call_-7139368589605204469","name":"search_medical_images","args":{"query":"human heart anatomy anatomical diagram","count":5}}]','[{"toolCallId":"call_-7139368589605204469","toolName":"search_medical_images","content":"{\\"found\\":true,\\"query\\":\\"human heart anatomy anatomical diagram\\",\\"images\\":[{\\"index\\":1,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"/generated/imgcache/6b15a64d1601d12b.jpg\\",\\"caption\\":\\"Anatomical heart poster with multiple labeled diagrams (cross section, oblique views) and extensive medical text; bottom corner curls up.\\",\\"source\\":\\"AnatomyStuff\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"1500pxx1500px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/1c92d8508bd8.jpg\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":2,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"/generated/imgcache/a6dc183d1c155e19.jpg\\",\\"caption\\":\\"Hand-drawn diagram titled \\\\\\"THE HUMAN HEART\\\\\\" with labeled parts (aorta, ventricles, atria, vena cava), blood flow arrows, and 123RF watermarks.\\",\\"source\\":\\"Pinterest\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"1136pxx1300px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/93223e8e522c.jpg\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":3,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"/generated/imgcache/c871cc295048a581.jpg\\",\\"caption\\":\\"Dark screenshot with large text: \\\\\\"Access Restricted - Your request has been blocked by our automated security systems...\\\\\\" Contains substantial text.\\",\\"source\\":\\"VectorStock\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"1000pxx1007px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/416f563e92c2.jpg\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":4,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"/generated/imgcache/af006472c3bc3c10.jpg\\",\\"caption\\":\\"A grayscale educational poster titled \\\\\\"HEART ANATOMY\\\\\\" showing a labeled cross-section of the heart (atria, ventricles, aorta, vena cava, apex), branded \\\\\\"AnatomyStuff\\\\\\" with logo, Instagram handle \\\\\\"@findanatomystuff\\\\\\", website \\\\\\"www.anatomystuff.co.uk\\\\\\", and copyright notice. Contains watermark/logo and branding text; not suitable for background image.\\",\\"source\\":\\"AnatomyStuff\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"1500pxx1500px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/34c1e02ac879.jpg\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":5,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/599909fa4431.png\\",\\"caption\\":\\"Vintage anatomical heart poster ad on aged paper, labeled Latin terms, \\\\\\"1643\\\\\\", promotional text: \\\\\\"Premium museum-quality paper\\\\\\", \\\\\\"Anatomically correct\\\\\\".\\",\\"source\\":\\"Animus Medicus\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"1080pxx1080px\\",\\"cached\\":false}],\\"note\\":\\"Show the most relevant images inline with their sources. Each imageUrl is a LOCAL copy that always loads — embed it directly as ![caption](imageUrl) and name the original source site next to it. sourceUrl (when present) is the original remote image for attribution; only embed sourceUrl if imageUrl somehow fails.\\"}","isError":false}]',NULL,'2026-10-25T23:35:13.554Z');
