- **File maintenance**: Instructions are loaded at conversation start; the file can be updated by asking the assistant to remember preferences','[{"id":"call_-7142062805410113697","name":"read_file","args":{"file_path":"/AGENTS.md"}}]','[{"toolCallId":"call_-7142062805410113697","toolName":"read_file","content":"@@ lines 1-18 of 18 @@\\n# AGENTS.md — my persistent instructions\\n\\nEverything in this file is loaded into the AI assistant''s instructions at the\\nstart of every conversation. Keep it short and specific.\\n\\n## About me\\n- I''m a medical learner preparing for: —\\n\\n## How to help me\\n- Explain the reasoning step by step before giving the answer\\n- Show the calculation whenever you do dose or unit math\\n\\n## Preferences\\n- Language: English\\n- Use metric units (mg, mL, kg)\\n\\n> Tip: ask the assistant in chat to update this file — e.g. \\"remember that I\\n> prefer flashcards over long summaries\\" — and it will edit AGENTS.md for you.","isError":false}]',NULL,'2026-10-25T23:44:47.892Z');
