The skill is now available in your skills library and will help ensure proper source attribution in all medical answers.','[{"id":"call_-7142057651449363846","name":"manage_skills","args":{"action":"create","name":"capability-demo-skill","description":"A simple skill that instructs to always cite sources in medical answers","body":"# Capability Demo Skill\\n\\n## Purpose\\nThis skill ensures that all medical answers include proper citations to sources.\\n\\n## When to Use\\nAlways use this skill when providing medical information or answering medical questions.\\n\\n## Instructions\\n- Always cite sources in medical answers using [S#] format for web sources and [K#] format for knowledge base sources\\n- Never provide medical information without proper citations\\n- Use search_medical_references for current guidelines and evidence\\n- Use search_knowledge for personal knowledge library content\\n- Include at least one relevant citation for every medical claim made\\n\\n## Citation Format\\n- Web sources: [S1], [S2], etc.\\n- Knowledge base sources: [K1], [K2], etc.\\n- Place citations immediately after the claims they support"}}]','[{"toolCallId":"call_-7142057651449363846","toolName":"manage_skills","content":"{\\"ok\\":true,\\"created\\":true,\\"skillId\\":\\"cmvoh68kt0023spwuhhmgi0pv\\",\\"name\\":\\"capability-demo-skill\\"}","isError":false}]',NULL,'2026-10-25T23:44:57.461Z');
