tion\\":\\"Scientific figure showing human heart proteomics workflow, with large amounts of text and data charts; not suitable for background image.\\",\\"source\\":\\"Nature\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"2029pxx1628px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/eca924d5f9b3.jpg\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":3,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"/generated/imgcache/9454ec978746f56d.jpg\\",\\"caption\\":\\"A labeled anatomical diagram of the human heart''s major vessels and structures with extensive text, copyrighted by Encyclopædia Britannica.\\",\\"source\\":\\"Britannica\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"2000pxx1380px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/810b7c968826.jpg\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":4,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"/generated/imgcache/b1e5570f2c3ec75d.png\\",\\"caption\\":\\"Scientific diagram comparing HFpEF pathology and Glabridin pharmacological therapy showing cardiomyocyte cell cycle, CCNA2, ROS, SASP, fibrosis.\\",\\"source\\":\\"Nature\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"950pxx868px\\",\\"sourceUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/96ee5201f46c.png\\",\\"cached\\":true},{\\"index\\":5,\\"imageUrl\\":\\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/9c1c478d2aa8.jpg\\",\\"caption\\":\\"Hand-drawn anatomical heart diagram with labels (SVC, IVC, valves, chambers); hand holding marker; contains multiple text labels.\\",\\"source\\":\\"Physiopedia\\",\\"dimensions\\":\\"1280pxx720px\\",\\"cached\\":false}],\\"note\\":\\"Show the most relevant images inline with their sources. Each imageUrl is a LOCAL copy that always loads — embed it directly as ![caption](imageUrl) and name the original source site next to it. sourceUrl (when present) is the original remote image for attribution; only embed sourceUrl if imageUrl somehow fails.\\"}","isError":false}]',NULL,'2026-10-25T23:50:24.658Z');
