rial advances in CAR-T therapy for solid tumors presented at the 2025 ASCO Meeting.\\n[S3] Major advance in use of CAR-T cell therapy to treat solid tumors\\n    https://www.mayoclinic.org/medical-professionals/cancer/news/major-advance-in-use-of-car-t-cell-therapy-to-treat-solid-tumors/mac-20588405 (www.mayoclinic.org)\\n    Sept. 03, 2025 Researchers at Mayo Clinic have made a promising breakthrough in the development of a novel therapy for solid tumor treatment.","note":"Cite these inline as [S1], [S2]… markers placed right after the claim each source supports. NEVER paste raw URLs into the answer text — the interface renders [S#] markers as clickable source cards and lists every URL in a Web sources panel automatically. Results are re-ranked for recency (freshest first): when a source carries a date, mention the year the moment you cite it (e.g. \\"per the 2024 ESC guideline [S1]\\"), and prefer the most recent guidance when sources conflict — flag older sources as superseded where relevant."}',NULL,'2026-10-24T06:13:43.017Z');
