INSERT INTO "AgentToolExecution" ("id","userId","threadId","toolName","status","latencyMs","inputJson","outputJson","error","createdAt") VALUES ('cmvm6nyuj0019fqrdunu2taw8','cmuser2vb0000scr8wuwwi596','0393944e-1fd0-4325-bffc-420f132f5106','save_question','completed',300006,'{"type":"mcq","text":"A 45-year-old female presents with fatigue, pallor, and shortness of breath on exertion. Laboratory findings show: Hemoglobin 8.2 g/dL, MCV 78 fL, MCH 27 pg, MCHC 32 g/dL, RDW 18%. Peripheral smear shows microcytic hypochromic red blood cells. What is the most likely diagnosis?","options":["Iron deficiency anemia","Vitamin B12 deficiency","Folate deficiency","Anemia of chronic disease","Thalassemia trait"],"answer":"Iron deficiency anemia","explanation":"This patient presents with classic findings of iron deficiency anemia: microcytic (low MCV) hypochromic (low MCHC) red blood cells, elevated RDW (reflecting variable red cell size), and symptoms consistent with anemia. Iron deficiency is the most common cause of microcytic anemia worldwide. The other options are incorrect because: Vitamin B12 and folate deficiencies typically cause macrocytic anemia (high MCV), anemia of chronic disease is usually normocytic, and thalassemia trait would show more specific findings like target cells and basophilic stippling.","mnemonic":"Microcytic hypochromic + elevated RDW = Iron deficiency","clinicalPearl":"Iron deficiency anemia is the most common nutritional deficiency worldwide and the most common cause of microcytic anemia.","distractorAnalysis":"Vitamin B12/folate: Cause macrocytic anemia, not microcytic. Anemia of chronic disease: Usually normocytic, not microcytic. Thalassemia: Would show more specific morphologic features like target cells.","difficulty":"Medium","system":"General","topic":"anemia","tags":["hematology","iron deficiency","microcytic anemia"],"imageUrl":"","audioUrl":"","illustrationDescription":"Peripheral blood smear showing microcytic hypochromic red blood cells in iron deficiency anemia"}','{"approved":false,"reason":"Timed out waiting for approval (5 minutes).","note":"Do not retry this tool call in this turn. Acknowledge the decision to the user and continue without performing the action."}',NULL,'2026-10-24T09:15:14.347Z');
