INSERT INTO "AgentToolExecution" ("id","userId","threadId","toolName","status","latencyMs","inputJson","outputJson","error","createdAt") VALUES ('cmvm90g8t000c9frdn4qidhnc','cmuser2vb0000scr8wuwwi596','eda46769-4c4d-4b12-8cab-62b5ee080408','search_medical_images','completed',34487,'{"query":"SGLT2 inhibitors heart failure mechanism of action","count":3}','{"found":true,"query":"SGLT2 inhibitors heart failure mechanism of action","images":[{"index":1,"imageUrl":"/generated/imgcache/1f0fb40ea7d35f4e.jpg","caption":"Medical diagram comparing heart failure mechanisms across ejection fraction ranges: reduced EF (neurohormonal activation, CV death) versus preserved EF (microvascular dysfunction, inflammation, comorbidities). Contains moderate text, data chart—suitable for reference material, not background image.","source":"Revista Española de Cardiología","dimensions":"2508pxx1712px","sourceUrl":"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/3b346dd8c5e1.jpeg","cached":true},{"index":2,"imageUrl":"/generated/imgcache/095e5538ce6fb2b0.jpg","caption":"This is a scientific flowchart diagram containing a large amount of text information; it illustrates how iSGLT2 inhibitors improve inflammation-driven functional iron deficiency, yielding nephroprotection and cardioprotection.","source":"Nefrología","dimensions":"3000pxx1112px","sourceUrl":"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/76666bba38ec.jpeg","cached":true}],"note":"Show the most relevant images inline with their sources. Each imageUrl is a LOCAL copy that always loads — embed it directly as ![caption](imageUrl) and name the original source site next to it. sourceUrl (when present) is the original remote image for attribution; only embed sourceUrl if imageUrl somehow fails."}',NULL,'2026-10-24T10:20:55.997Z');
