INSERT INTO "AgentToolExecution" ("id","userId","threadId","toolName","status","latencyMs","inputJson","outputJson","error","createdAt") VALUES ('cmvmj0k9q000czird05mmxmcn','cmusenr950006oir80jr4ludo','a93633c9-bb1f-43d6-9cc0-0762fa8bf42b','create_presentation','completed',10,'{"title":"Anemia: Clinical Overview","slides":"[{\\"title\\": \\"Anemia: Clinical Overview\\", \\"content\\": \\"- Definition: Hb < normal range\\\\n- Most common hematologic disorder\\\\n- Global health burden\\\\n- Clinical impact on outcomes\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Understanding the basics\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Why It Matters\\", \\"content\\": \\"- 1.6B people affected worldwide\\\\n- Leading cause of disability\\\\n- Mortality in severe cases\\\\n- Quality of life impact\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Epidemiology & Significance\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Classification\\", \\"content\\": \\"- By morphology:\\\\n  • Microcytic (MCV < 80)\\\\n  • Normocytic (MCV 80-100)\\\\n  • Macrocytic (MCV > 100)\\\\n- By pathogenesis:\\\\n  • Production vs destruction\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Morphologic & Pathophysiologic\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Pathophysiology\\", \\"content\\": \\"- Decreased red cell production\\\\n  • Bone marrow failure\\\\n  • Nutrient deficiencies\\\\n- Increased red cell loss\\\\n  • Hemolysis\\\\n  • Acute/chronic blood loss\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Mechanisms of Anemia\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Clinical Approach\\", \\"content\\": \\"- History: fatigue, dyspnea, pallor\\\\n- Physical: vital signs, mucous membranes\\\\n- Labs: CBC, reticulocyte count\\\\n- Workup: iron studies, B12, folate\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Diagnosis & Evaluation\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Management\\", \\"content\\": \\"- Treat underlying cause\\\\n- Iron replacement (oral/IV)\\\\n- B12/folate supplementation\\\\n- Transfusion for severe cases\\\\n- Address complications\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Treatment Strategies\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}, {\\"title\\": \\"Key Takeaways\\", \\"content\\": • Always determine etiology\\\\n• Consider severity & symptoms\\\\n• Monitor treatment response\\\\n• Prevent complications\\\\n• Multidisciplinary approach\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Clinical Pearls\\", \\"image\\": \\"\\", \\"imageCaption\\": \\"\\"}]"}','{"created":false,"error":"Invalid slides: Unexpected token ''•'', ...\\"content\\": • Always d\\"... is not valid JSON"}',NULL,'2026-10-24T15:00:57.374Z');
