Reproductive System","weeks":0,"reason":"7% of the exam"},{"area":"Endocrine System","weeks":0,"reason":"8% of the exam"},{"area":"Multisystem Processes & Disorders","weeks":0,"reason":"8% of the exam"}],"note":"Approximate published content distribution (midpoints of official ranges). ALWAYS tell the learner to verify against the current official test plan (USMLE.org / NCSBN) before committing weeks. When you also have weakness data (analyze_my_weaknesses), shift 1-2 weeks from their strongest high-weight areas toward weak high-weight areas. Sequence suggestion: foundational/high-weight areas early, weakest areas getting two passes (learn + revisit), final 1-2 weeks for review + practice questions."}',NULL,'2026-10-24T20:33:48.391Z');
