evaluated for ACE inhibitor the"},{"index":6,"id":"cmvo2lqmm000mguwumps0cdp4","type":"mcq","system":"General","topic":"ACE inhibitors","difficulty":"Medium","preview":"A pregnant patient at 12 weeks gestation with chronic hypertension is considering antihypertensive therapy. Which of the following statement"}],"note":"Summarize what was saved (count + topics + difficulty) and remind the user the new questions are pending review in the question bank."}',NULL,'2026-10-25T16:53:57.652Z');
