INSERT INTO "AgentToolExecution" ("id","userId","threadId","toolName","status","latencyMs","inputJson","outputJson","error","createdAt") VALUES ('cmvqpujkw0017e9oi7safuh47','cmuser2vb0000scr8wuwwi596',NULL,'save_question','completed',12738,'{"type":"mcq","text":"A 68-year-old man with chronic kidney disease (eGFR 25 mL/min) presents with progressive fatigue and hemoglobin of 9.0 g/dL. His serum iron is normal, ferritin is 80 ng/mL, and transferrin saturation is 25%. Which of the following is the MOST appropriate initial treatment for his anemia?","options":["Intravenous iron supplementation","Oral ferrous sulfate 325 mg daily","Erythropoiesis-stimulating agent (ESA) with iron supplementation","Vitamin B12 injections","Folate supplementation"],"answer":"Erythropoiesis-stimulating agent (ESA) with iron supplementation","explanation":"This patient has anemia of chronic kidney disease (CKD), which is characterized by relative erythropoietin deficiency. The appropriate treatment is an erythropoiesis-stimulating agent (ESA) combined with iron supplementation to optimize response. Iron supplementation alone is insufficient in CKD due to impaired erythropoietin production. Oral iron may be used but is less effective than IV iron in CKD patients. Vitamin B12 and folate are not indicated as the laboratory findings don''t suggest deficiency.","mnemonic":"CKD Anemia = ESA + Iron","clinicalPearl":"In CKD anemia, target hemoglobin is typically 10-11.5 g/dL to avoid complications from both anemia and excessive erythropoiesis stimulation.","distractorAnalysis":"Option A (IV iron alone) is insufficient without ESA in CKD. Option B (oral iron) is less effective in CKD. Option D (B12) and E (folate) are not indicated based on normal iron studies.","difficulty":"Medium","system":"nephrology","topic":"anemia treatment","tags":["chronic kidney disease","anemia of chronic disease","erythropoietin"],"imageUrl":"","audioUrl":"","illustrationDescription":"","attachSourceMediaId":"","citations":[{"sourceId":"cmv6wresk0012j6rmn8yzcdiz","chunkId":"cmv6ytwok00bubjrmxz00k6em"}]}','{"saved":true,"id":"cmvqputeo0019e9oiad8qr0lw","index":2,"message":"Question 2 saved (id cmvqputeo0019e9oiad8qr0lw). Continue with the next question or summarize when done."}',NULL,'2026-10-27T13:23:18.560Z');
